text = "Floor tiling test - all slabs 20x20 m, one texture per N metres.
Left to right (west to east):   1   2   4   5   10   20 m per texture
Behind you (north):  a 120 x 60 m slab at 5 m, for distance falloff.
20 m = one texture across the whole slab, which is what PhaseMaze's floor does.
R resets the slice (Play only; in the editor click the corner axis gizmo)."
